---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = "Best VPNs for Traveling in China";
const description = "The best VPNs for China — what works, what doesn't, and how to set up your VPN before you arrive.";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="en">
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <header class="mb-12">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3">🔒 Life in China</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">
        Best VPNs for Traveling in China
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-6">Set it up before you go — or you won't get online.</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500">
        <span>📅 Last updated: June 2026</span>
        <span>⏱️ 5 min read</span>
      </div>
    </header>

        <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-green-50 to-emerald-50 border-l-4 border-green-500 rounded-r-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-green-900 mb-4">🎯 Quick Answer</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-green-800 leading-relaxed">
        <strong>Set up your VPN before you leave home.</strong> Once you're inside China, VPN websites and Google Play are blocked — you won't be able to download or subscribe from there.
      </p>
    </div>

        <nav class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">📋 In This Guide</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-3">
        <li><a href="#why" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">❓ Why You Need a VPN in China</a></li>
        <li><a href="#best" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🏆 Best VPNs for China</a></li>
        <li><a href="#setup" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">⚙️ How to Set Up Your VPN Before You Go</a></li>
        <li><a href="#troubleshoot" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🔧 Troubleshooting: VPN Not Working?</a></li>
        <li><a href="#free-vs-paid" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">💰 Free VPNs vs Paid VPNs</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="why" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">❓</span> Why You Need a VPN in China
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">China's internet firewall blocks a long list of Western websites and services, including:</p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-12 not-prose">
        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">📱 Social media</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700">Instagram, Facebook, Twitter/X, TikTok (international version)</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">💬 Messaging</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700">WhatsApp, Telegram (partially blocked), Signal</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">🔍 Search & maps</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700">Google (all services), including Gmail</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">🎵 Video & music</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700">YouTube, Netflix, Spotify</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 md:col-span-2">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">📰 News</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700">BBC, CNN, New York Times</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-12">If you rely on any of these for work, communication, or entertainment, a VPN is essential.</p>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="best" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🏆</span> Best VPNs for China
      </h2>

      <div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-100 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-6">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-blue-900 mb-3">🚀 ExpressVPN</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-700">
          <li>One of the most reliable options for China (works with obfuscation technology)</li>
          <li>Fast speeds for streaming and video calls</li>
          <li>30-day money-back guarantee</li>
        </ul>
        <!-- AFFILIATE: ExpressVPN 联盟链接 -->
      </div>

      <div class="bg-green-50 border border-green-100 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-6">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-green-900 mb-3">🛡️ NordVPN</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-700">
          <li>Large server network with obfuscated servers designed for restricted networks</li>
          <li>Strong security features (kill switch, double VPN)</li>
          <li>Occasionally needs to switch servers if one gets blocked</li>
        </ul>
        <!-- AFFILIATE: NordVPN 联盟链接 -->
      </div>

      <div class="bg-purple-50 border border-purple-100 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-6">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-purple-900 mb-3">🐉 Surfshark</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-700">
          <li>Budget-friendly with unlimited device connections</li>
          <li>Works in China with its NoBorders mode</li>
          <li>Good option for longer trips or group/family travel</li>
        </ul>
        <!-- AFFILIATE: Surfshark 联盟链接 -->
      </div>

      <div class="bg-yellow-50 border border-yellow-100 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-12">
        <p class="text-gray-700"><strong>Pro tip:</strong> Download and install at least <strong>two</strong> VPNs before your trip. If one gets blocked or has issues, you'll have a backup ready to go.</p>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="setup" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">⚙️</span> How to Set Up Your VPN Before You Go
      </h2>

      <div class="bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
        <ol class="space-y-4">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="bg-blue-500 text-white w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold flex-shrink-0">1</span>
            <div><strong>Choose a provider</strong> from the list above</div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="bg-blue-500 text-white w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold flex-shrink-0">2</span>
            <div><strong>Sign up and download</strong> the app on all your devices (phone, laptop, tablet)</div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="bg-blue-500 text-white w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold flex-shrink-0">3</span>
            <div><strong>Install and log in</strong> while still at home</div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="bg-blue-500 text-white w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold flex-shrink-0">4</span>
            <div><strong>Test it</strong> — connect to a server outside China and make sure it works</div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="bg-blue-500 text-white w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold flex-shrink-0">5</span>
            <div><strong>Enable the kill switch</strong> (cuts internet if VPN drops — important in China)</div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="bg-blue-500 text-white w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold flex-shrink-0">6</span>
            <div><strong>Save the provider's website</strong> in case you need to re-download the app</div>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="troubleshoot" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🔧</span> Troubleshooting: VPN Not Working?
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-8">If your VPN stops working while you're in China:</p>

      <div class="space-y-4 mb-12 not-prose">
        <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">🔄 Switch servers</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700">Some IPs get blocked over time. Try a different server location.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">🔧 Try a different protocol</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700">OpenVPN or WireGuard may work better than the default protocol.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">📞 Contact support</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700">ExpressVPN and NordVPN have 24/7 live chat that can suggest working servers.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">📱 Use your backup VPN</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700">This is why we recommend having two.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="free-vs-paid" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">💰</span> Free VPNs vs Paid VPNs
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6"><strong>Free VPNs are not recommended for China.</strong> Here's why:</p>

      <ul class="space-y-4 mb-12">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 bg-red-50 rounded-xl">
          <span class="text-red-500 text-xl">🚫</span>
          <div>
            <strong>Most free VPNs don't work:</strong> They don't have servers configured to bypass China's firewall.
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 bg-red-50 rounded-xl">
          <span class="text-red-500 text-xl">🐌</span>
          <div>
            <strong>Slow speeds and data caps:</strong> Free services are often too slow for video calls or streaming.
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 bg-red-50 rounded-xl">
          <span class="text-red-500 text-xl">🔓</span>
          <div>
            <strong>Privacy risks:</strong> Some free VPNs have been known to log and sell user data — risky in China.
          </div>
        </li>
      </ul>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-12">Stick with a paid provider. The cost is low ($5–$13/month) compared to the headache of being stuck without internet access during your trip.</p>

      <!-- AFFILIATE: VPN 提供商联盟计划汇总 — ExpressVPN, NordVPN, Surfshark -->
    </div>

        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">📚 Related Guides</h3>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <a href="/en/life/survival-kit/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">🎒 Your China Trip Survival Kit</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">The complete pre-travel checklist</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/en/life/sim-card-guide/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">📶 Best SIM Card & eSIM for Tourists</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Your data connection options</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/en/tips/is-china-safe/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">🛡️ Is it safe to travel to China?</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Safety tips from a local</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>